    "intro_narrative": "You are a private investigator who has just broken into the abandoned Blackwood Research Facility. Rumors suggest this site was the headquarters of a notorious syndicate that left behind a complex web of interconnected security modules. The air is stale, and the hum of backup generators is the only sound. Your objective is to navigate through the darkened corridors, reactivate the dormant systems, and bypass the facility's layers of defense to crack the final vault. Keep your wits about you, as every machine and terminal is a piece of a larger puzzle.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
